        "text": "§\n\nAdverse Effects (7) : Non-selective NSAIDs",
        "imageIds": []
    },
    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nAdverse Effects (7) : Non-selective NSAIDs\n\n(1) GI erosions\n(2) Bleeding\n\n(3) ↓ Na+ excretion ⇒ ↑ BP\n\n(4) Interstitial nephritis\n\n(5) Renal papillary necrosis\n\n(6) Aplastic anemia\n\n(7) Hypoaldosteronism\n\n(Bleeding often presents as GI bleed)\n\n[Image: c25f269266f043d449a9d06b0048fbb643724c56ca6a18b6da967c5ac34c8019]\n\n[Image: 259ee7c856c6493d542675dd9dc9b134087b9152b3e8ff37bf1ca253e6f6e4c4]\n\n[Image: c8b5d3b942e0402d1940e1855b4a8379f9d8bb4934c67d0dd8e5f9827bfd0be3]\n\n[Image: 97cccaf0e276f0b4fb81f194ec3abb7bb3acee61c1c5b0713b6511069354ef60]\n\n[Image: 3dcb2b53fa07e6b1718ea66572336a743139aca7fb6fa82b7f7d552592177fe5]\n\n[Image: 1751181780a7b73cc7948f05978bcf446c3685d82fc38ef1de0ffbe1f0c5f691]\n\n[Image: 85bc26d17d61a2f9c069cdd5a47c0cf523ad1e97952ade118efcbc38bbccce13]\n\n3.1 - NSAIDs\n[Image: 49edae9fb6b61c742ab1ec590c3ccd72c55b9cee6f90a3510f101bb2aeafd075]\n\n[Image: be01556d0a9edc1e3ee92acf212fee5500ea23a6cad86d819219c19dc42aa5bb]\n\n[Image: bd78a3a4c103ea0ed274bd5ef754ad00174438c9fce7199d32239a53a34e7942]\n\n[Image: a09abee6ad5a84c5e948912aa4d09a6910a56c49466db92e12cae9b8f08908d3]\n\n[Image: 21f549501b36d1616894b1f5dcafb9faa34fcc787da3259419404bb46a3858f8]\n\n[Image: b41c26cf16765ec4c5de8753112f86a26eec8e25363e99d239b196c3f5606dfd]\n\n[Image: 13bd466f519ed3975e8a5543d9f6c9760bf12de1b89001b33b725ceb5d90be46]",
